{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ere4WNrhdkaa5KZmKw32ZF","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"Robot Learning Foundation\",\"url\":\"https://www.robot-learning.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for Reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found some information about CoRL 2026, though specific detailed reviewer guidelines and review form documentation for CoRL 2026 were not directly available in these results.\n\nHere's what I found:\n\n**CoRL 2026 Overview:**\nThe Conference on Robot Learning (CoRL) is an annual international conference focusing on the intersection of robotics and machine learning, and CoRL 2026 will be held in Austin, Texas, US.\n\n**Reviewer Requirements:**\nAll submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer, and they are qualified if they have at least one accepted publication at a previous robotics (CoRL/ICRA/IROS/RSS) or learning conference (ICLR/NeurIPS/ICML) or equivalent journal. Additionally, every author with 3 or more submissions must agree to serve as a reviewer.\n\nFor more detailed information about the specific review form and comprehensive reviewer guidelines for CoRL 2026, you may want to check the OpenReview platform directly at https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference or visit the main CoRL 2026 website at https://www.corl.org/. The search results from CoRL 2024 and 2023 do contain reviewer instructions that may be similar in structure to what CoRL 2026 uses.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"de8902b1-95db-4d6b-992d-38f39dba7b46","uuid":"99eb5add-f345-459e-a164-1b26a79c13d8","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:17:58.024Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SVq6oiXmQkkheLzpgg2vKH","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2026","url":"https://www.corl.org/"},{"title":"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"Robot Learning Foundation","url":"https://www.robot-learning.org/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"Instructions for Reviewers","url":"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025