{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B5BJB8R4XUw9kbssjSSzZw","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 acceptance rate statistics\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"Conference on Robot Learning on X: \\\"#CoRL got 671 submissions this year. This is huge! See below for the development. 👇 (this number is already without obvious desk rejections) https://t.co/HfrSQ2ILyO\\\" / X\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/corl_conf/status/1801514565236076868\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701\"},{\"title\":\"Artificial Intelligence in Healthcare: 2024 Year in Review\",\"url\":\"https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2025.02.26.25322978.full.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056528/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found some information about CoRL 2024 submissions, but the specific acceptance rate percentage is not provided in these results.\n\nHere's what I found:\n\nCoRL 2024 received 671 submissions, with this number already excludin