{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CFTn1j8j9hNBdkTVxFjAow","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL review form \"overall score\" \"1\" \"2\" \"3\" \"4\" \"5\" accept reject site:corl\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2022 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2022-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2021 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2021-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2022 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2022-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2021 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2021-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"Analyzing the Machine Learning Conference Review Process\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2011.12919\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found information about CoRL's review scoring system. Papers receive ratings on a scale where reviewers assign scores like 3, 4, and 5, with the average score used in the distribution. The search results indicate that CoRL uses a numerical scoring system and distinguishes between \"Accept\" and \"Reject\" tiers for decision-making.\n\nHowever, the search results don't provide detailed specifications of the exact review form with all the specific score descriptors (what each number 1-5