er the negative result (SDF redundancy) is sufficiently powered to be conclusive, and whether the metric contribution (dfCAR) is sufficiently general.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01M8ZrCe84utiTV3pJUPcEMY","session_id":"de8902b1-95db-4d6b-992d-38f39dba7b46","uuid":"515f029f-3ef4-4138-8b23-7ab2c8d3c11e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:19:22.435Z"}
