{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V4Mnct1fAmp9i8kj4Mpsgp","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 diff_collision_sdf 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (80 个)\\n\\n- **baseline_lora_spatial_bowl_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **eval_a3_v10a_refine**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **eval_a3_object_pudding_no_refine**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **eval_a3_object_pudding_refine**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s0_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **baseline_object_pudding_s0_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s0**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s1**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **baseline_object_pudding_s0**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-26\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| eval_pi05_baseline_reeval_disp | Pi0.5 base model (no LoRA, no SDF) re-eval with fixed eval script on object_pudding 200ep: obtain EE displacement data for dfCAR baseline comparison. Expect CAR ≈ 27% (known baseline) with EE displacement distribution needed for dfCAR threshold analysis. | — | — | — |\\n| train_pi05_lora_baseline_s2 | LoRA baseline (no SDF auxiliary loss) seed 2 on object_pudding for 30K steps: third seed for LoRA-only attribution control, enabling 3v3 seed statistical comparison with SDF-trained models. Expected CAR ≈ 55% (consistent with s0=54.5%, s1=56%). | — | — | — |\\n| train_pi05_a1_obj_s1_l01_high | Pi0.5+A1 SDF training with high lambda=0.1 (seed1, 30K steps). Second seed for lambda=0.1 to provide error bars. Paired with seed0 (GPU 1) to test whether stronger SDF penalty produces faster collision avoidance or earlier over-avoidance onset. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- eval_pi05_a1_best_s0_l005: Pi0.5+A1 best checkpoint eval (seed0, λ=0.005) using /best/ checkpoint. Completes 3-seed best-checkpoint coverage (s1 best=step16K, s2 best=step10K already done). s0 best=step26000. Tests whether best-loss checkpoint CAR/TSR matches s1/s2 pattern.（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2** (success): LoRA baseline (no SDF) 30K eval on object_pudding seed 0 (v2, base env fix): expects CAR ≈ Pi0.5 baseline (~27%), confirming ColliForce CAR improvement is from SDF not LoRA. Critical for Claim 4 SDF attribution + dfCAR ee_displacement data. ← 基于 train_pi05_lora_baseline_s0\\n- **eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2** (success): LoRA baseline (no SDF) 30K eval on object_pudding seed 1 (v2, base env fix): second seed for LoRA-only attribution. Paired with s0 for error bars. ← 基于 train_pi05_lora_baseline_s1\\n- **eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1** (failed): LoRA baseline (no SDF) 30K eval on object_pudding seed 1: second seed for LoRA-only attribution. Same expected outcome as s0. Parent: train_pi05_lora_baseline_s1. ← 基于 train_pi05_lora_baseline_s1\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 34 / 负向 16 / 失败 10 / 共 73\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-35807: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\nwestd-45947: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\n\\n## 告警\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- baseline_object_pudding_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_object_pudding_refine: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_object_pudding_no_refine: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_spatial_force_refine_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_spatial_m024fix_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- oracle_true_gt_object_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- oracle_true_gt_feature_object_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- train_pi05_a1_obj_l005: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- train_pi05_a1_obj_l01: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpquHRciCqyWfEg2rG3pto","session_id":"de8902b1-95db-4d6b-992d-38f39dba7b46","uuid":"9c2eb960-9eb4-4dc6-b012-4795348fff90","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:19:54.155Z"}
