{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ngyb8oJedcY2K5f1YkyXMk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# ColliForce-VLA Literature Map\\\\n# Updated: 2026-05-25\\\\n\\\\npapers:\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 已有论文 =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2512.11891\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"VLSA: Vision-Language-Action Models with Plug-and-Play Safety Constraint Layer\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Hu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: collision-aware-vla\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"AEGIS/SafeLIBERO — 用 CBF 安全约束层实现 VLA 碰撞回避，是外挂式安全机制，不改变 VLA 内部空间表征；ColliForce 的核心对比对象。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2510.14836\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"QDepth-VLA: Quantized Depth Prediction as Auxiliary Supervision for Vision-Language-Action Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: spatial-aware-vla\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"用量化深度预测作为 VLA 辅助监督增强空间推理；与 ColliForce 的 SDF 辅助损失思路类似但用深度而非 SDF，且在 camera frame 而非 workspace frame。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2510.12276\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Spatial Forcing: Implicit Spatial Representation Alignment for Vision-language-action Model\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: ICLR 2026\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: spatial-aware-vla\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"隐式对齐 VLA 中间层视觉嵌入与 3D 基础模型几何表征，证明隐式 3D 对齐对 VLA 有效；ColliForce 将对齐目标从通用 3D 几何特化为 SDF/occupancy field。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2307.05973\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"VoxPoser: Composable 3D Value Maps for Robotic Manipulation with Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Huang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: CoRL 2023\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"用 LLM 生成 3D 体素 value maps（含 avoidance maps）引导机器人操作规划；启发了 ColliForce 用 3D 空间场引导动作生成的思路。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2410.24164\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"pi0: A Vision-Language-Action Flow Model for General Robot Control\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Black et al., Physical Intelligence\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    role: backbone\\\\n    category: vla-foundation\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"基于 PaliGemma VLM + flow matching 的通用 VLA 基座模型；ColliForce 的基座架构，在其上添加 SDF 辅助监督分支。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"1901.05103\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"DeepSDF: Learning Continuous Signed Distance Functions for Shape Representation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Park et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2019\\\\n    venue: CVPR 2019\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-representation\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"开创性地用深度网络学习连续 SDF 表示；ColliForce 中 workspace SDF 的表征方法论基础。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2307.00533\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Representing Robot Geometry as Distance Fields: Applications to Whole-body Manipulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Liu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    one_line_summary: \\\\\\\"用 Bernstein 多项式编码机器人连杆 SDF 并集成到优化问题中实现可微碰撞检测；验证了 SDF 在机器人碰撞检测中的可行性。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P0: 直接竞品 — 碰撞感知操纵 / Safe Manipulation =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2503.03480\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"SafeVLA: Towards Safety Alignment of Vision-Language-Action Model via Constrained Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Zhang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: NeurIPS 2025 (Spotlight)\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2503.03480\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: collision-aware-vla\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"用 CMDP 范式对 VLA 策略施加安全约束，通过 safe RL 优化减少 83.58% 安全违规成本。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"最直接竞品之一：同样关注 VLA 安全性，但走 constrained RL 路线（外部约束优化），ColliForce 走内部空间表征增强路线（SDF 辅助监督），方法论互补。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2407.00451\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Language-Guided Object-Centric Diffusion Policy for Collision-Aware Robotic Manipulation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: ICRA 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2407.00451\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: collision-aware-vla\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"在 3D 点云上训练 diffusion policy 预测末端轨迹，推理时通过 cost-guided denoising 实现 training-free 碰撞回避。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"碰撞回避在推理阶段通过 cost optimization 注入；ColliForce 在训练阶段通过 SDF 辅助损失嵌入碰撞感知，设计哲学不同。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2511.22773\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"CAPE: Context-Aware Diffusion Policy Via Proximal Mode Expansion for Collision Avoidance\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Yang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2511.22773\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: collision-aware-vla\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"通过 context-aware prior 和 prior-seeded iterative guided refinement 扩展轨迹分布模态，cluttered 场景碰撞回避提升 26-80%。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"推理阶段碰撞回避方法，与 ColliForce 训练阶段 SDF 注入形成对比；可讨论 train-time vs. test-time 安全注入的 trade-off。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2409.08233\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Towards Online Safety Corrections for Robotic Manipulation Policies\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Spalter et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2409.08233\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: collision-aware-vla\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"iKinQP-RL：用逆运动学 QP 控制器在运行时修正 RL 策略动作，完全消除与未见障碍物的碰撞。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"运行时安全修正层，类似 VLSA 的外挂思路；ColliForce 不需额外安全层，通过 SDF 辅助监督让策略自身学会碰撞感知。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P0b: 碰撞感知操纵补充 (2024-2026) =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2601.21712\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"CoFreeVLA: Collision-Free Dual-Arm Manipulation via Vision-Language-Action Model and Risk Estimation\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Zhai et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2026\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2601.21712\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: direct-competitor\\\\n    category: collision-aware-vla\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"在 VLA 策略上外挂短时域自碰撞风险估计器，预测碰撞概率并门控危险动作，通过 risk-guided 调整恢复安全状态。在 PiPER 双臂平台 5 个任务上减少自碰撞并提升成功率。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"VLA + 碰撞安全的最新工作；采用外部风险估计器（post-hoc 过滤）路线，与 ColliForce 训练时 SDF 嵌入的内在路线形成对比。可讨论 internal representation vs. external filter 的 trade-off。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2404.02284\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"APEX: Ambidextrous Dual-Arm Robotic Manipulation Using Collision-Free Generative Diffusion Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Dastider et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: IROS 2024\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2404.02284\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: related-approach\\\\n    category: collision-aware-manipulation\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"用潜在扩散模型生成双臂操作轨迹，通过 classifier-guidance 技术集成障碍物信息保证轨迹无碰撞。在双臂硬件平台上超越传统运动规划算法。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"Test-time classifier-guidance 碰撞回避，与 Lan-o3dp/CAPE 同属推理阶段安全注入方法族；ColliForce 在训练阶段通过 SDF 辅助损失嵌入，不需推理时额外计算。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2512.11908\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Safe Learning for Contact-Rich Robot Tasks: A Survey from Classical Learning-Based Methods to Safe Foundation Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Zhang et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2512.11908\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: survey\\\\n    category: collision-aware-manipulation\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"系统综述安全接触任务的学习方法，覆盖 constrained RL、risk-sensitive optimization、CBF、MPC safety shields，并延伸到 foundation model 时代的安全挑战。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"Related Work 定位参考：ColliForce 属于该综述分类中 'training-time geometric supervision' 类别，与 constrained RL (SafeVLA) 和 runtime shields (VLSA/iKinQP) 构成三条路线。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P1: SDF/距离场在机器人学中的应用 =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2204.02296\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"iSDF: Real-Time Neural Signed Distance Fields for Robot Perception\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Ortiz et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2022\\\\n    venue: RSS 2022\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2204.02296\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"从流式深度图像持续学习神经 SDF，将 3D 坐标映射为有符号距离值，实现实时机器人场景感知。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"验证了神经 SDF 可实时构建用于机器人感知；ColliForce 的 workspace SDF ground truth 生成和在线推理可参考其方法。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2305.10534\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"RAMP: Hierarchical Reactive Motion Planning for Manipulation Tasks Using Implicit Signed Distance Functions\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Vasilopoulos et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: IROS 2023\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2305.10534\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"结合 MPPI 控制器和局部向量场控制器，用 SDF 做碰撞检测和反应式避障的层次化运动规划。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"展示 SDF 在 reactive manipulation planning 中的有效性；ColliForce 将 SDF 从规划模块提升到学习模块，让策略网络直接编码距离场信息。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2102.07413\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"DiffCo: Auto-Differentiable Proxy Collision Detection with Multi-class Labels for Safety-Aware Trajectory Optimization\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Zhi et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2021\\\\n    venue: IEEE T-RO\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2102.07413\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"全自动可微的非参数碰撞检测模型，在线计算碰撞边界并通过反向传播提供鲁棒梯度用于轨迹优化。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"可微碰撞检测关键工作，证明碰撞信息可通过梯度传播融入优化；ColliForce 的 SDF 辅助损失本质也是让碰撞信息参与梯度反传。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P1b: SDF/距离场在机器人学补充 (2024-2025) =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2406.01137\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Configuration Space Distance Fields for Manipulation Planning\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Li, Chi, Razmjoo, Calinon\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: RSS 2024\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2406.01137\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"将 SDF 从任务空间扩展到机器人构型空间（C-space），直接估计到达接触/碰撞所需的最小关节运动量，并用于操作规划优化。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"直接回应 ColliForce 的 EE-only SDF 局限：CDF 在 C-space 工作天然覆盖全身碰撞，Related Work 中可作为 full-body SDF 方案的代表，讨论 task-space SDF vs. C-space SDF 的优劣。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2409.14955\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Efficient Collision Detection Framework for Enhancing Collision-Free Robot Motion\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Zhu et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2409.14955\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"通过正运动学分解机器人全身 SDF，用多个轻量并行网络近似各连杆 SDF，集成 SVM 自碰撞检测模块（SDF-SC），保持可微性用于轨迹优化。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"全身 SDF 分解方案，与 Liu et al. (2023) Bernstein 多项式方法互补；ColliForce 目前仅用 EE SDF，该工作展示了扩展到全身 SDF 的工程可行性。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2511.21312\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Neural NMPC through Signed Distance Field Encoding for Collision Avoidance\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Jacquet, Harms, Alexis\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: IJRR 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2511.21312\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    category: sdf-robotics\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"用卷积编码器将深度图像压缩为潜向量，MLP 近似对应空间 SDF，作为 NMPC 的显式位置约束实现无地图碰撞回避。森林环境真机验证。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"展示 SDF 作为控制约束的端到端集成路径（感知→SDF→控制）；ColliForce 将 SDF 集成到学习策略（感知→SDF→policy loss），两者互为对照。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P2: VLA 基座模型系列 =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2307.15818\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"RT-2: Vision-Language-Action Models Transfer Web Knowledge to Robotic Control\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Brohan et al., Google DeepMind\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2307.15818\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: foundational\\\\n    category: vla-foundation\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"将动作表示为文本 token，在视觉-语言任务和机器人轨迹数据上联合微调 VLM，实现网络知识到机器人控制的迁移。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"VLA 范式奠基工作，确立 VLM→VLA 微调范式；ColliForce 在此范式基础上增加 SDF 辅助分支。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2406.09246\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"OpenVLA: An Open-Source Vision-Language-Action Model\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Kim et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2406.09246\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: benchmark-source\\\\n    category: vla-foundation\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"7B 参数开源 VLA，基于 Llama 2 + DINOv2/SigLIP，970k 真实演示训练，29 任务上超越 RT-2-X 16.5%。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"主要 VLA baseline；ColliForce 可在其上验证 SDF 辅助监督的通用性。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2405.12213\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Octo: An Open-Source Generalist Robot Policy\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Octo Model Team\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2024\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2405.12213\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: benchmark-source\\\\n    category: vla-foundation\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"基于 Transformer 的通用策略，Open X-Embodiment 800k 轨迹训练，支持多传感器多动作空间，消费级 GPU 可快速微调。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"轻量级 VLA baseline；ColliForce 的 SDF 辅助分支可测试在小模型上的效果。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P3: Benchmark =====\\\\n\\\\n  - title: \\\\\\\"LIBERO: Benchmarking Knowledge Transfer for Lifelong Robot Learning\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Bo Liu, Yifeng Zhu, Chongkai Gao, Yihao Feng, Qiang Liu, Yuke Zhu, Peter Stone\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"NeurIPS 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2306.03310\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: benchmark\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"SafeLIBERO benchmark 的基础；定义了 Spatial/Goal/Object/Long 四个 suite 的任务结构和评估协议\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P4: 生成式建模基础方法 =====\\\\n\\\\n  - title: \\\\\\\"Flow Matching for Generative Modeling\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Yaron Lipman, Ricky T. Q. Chen, Heli Ben-Hamu, Maximilian Nickel, Matt Le\\\\\\\"\\\\n    venue: \\\\\\\"ICLR 2023\\\\\\\"\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2210.02747\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: method-component\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"π0 base model 使用的 flow matching 训练范式；ColliForce gradient-guided refinement 基于 flow matching 的 ODE solver 进行梯度注入\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P5: Action Collapse / Mode Collapse =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2505.11123\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Conditioning Matters: Training Diffusion Policies is Faster Than You Think\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Dong et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: arXiv\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2505.11123\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: related-approach\\\\n    category: action-collapse\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"发现 diffusion policy 训练中的 'loss collapse'——observation 条件难区分时训练退化为建模 marginal action 分布而非 condition-specific 分布，提出 Cocos 通过条件依赖的源分布锚定解决。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"与 ColliForce 的 action collapse 机制类似：collision penalty 可导致策略忽略 task-relevant conditioning 而坍缩到 degenerate marginal（如静止不动），提供了 diffusion policy 中 loss collapse 的理论对照。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2303.04137\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Diffusion Policy: Visuomotor Policy Learning via Action Diffusion\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Chi et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: RSS 2023 / IJRR 2024\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2303.04137\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: foundational\\\\n    category: action-collapse\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"提出基于扩散模型的视觉运动策略，解决行为克隆中的 mode averaging 问题——标准回归策略在多模态演示上取均值产生不安全的中间轨迹。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"定义了 IL 中 mode averaging/collapse 的规范表述；ColliForce 的 collision penalty 可能在表达性策略架构中重新引入类似的模态坍缩，将动作分布推向单一 'freeze' 模态。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  # ===== 新增 P6: Safe RL / Safe Imitation Learning =====\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"1705.10528\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"Constrained Policy Optimization\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Achiam et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2017\\\\n    venue: ICML 2017\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"1705.10528\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: foundational\\\\n    category: safe-rl\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"训练时安全 RL 基础方法，在 trust-region 框架中约束策略更新满足 cost 限制，形式化为 constrained MDP。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"Safe RL 奠基工作；仅用标量 cost 信号，不含几何碰撞信息，不处理高维视觉-语言观测空间。ColliForce 的可微 SDF 辅助损失提供比 CPO 标量约束更丰富的连续几何安全信号。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2409.19190\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"RAIL: Reachability-Aided Imitation Learning for Safe Policy Execution\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Jung et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: ICRA 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2409.19190\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: related-approach\\\\n    category: safe-rl\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"测试时安全方法：训练标准 IL 策略后用可达性分析安全过滤器在运行时覆盖不安全动作，实现 0% 碰撞率。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"策略本身不学安全，与 ColliForce 训练时 SDF 嵌入形成对比。解耦方式意味着过滤器频繁干预时可能降低任务性能，ColliForce 通过让策略原生碰撞感知来避免这一问题。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n  - paper_id: \\\\\\\"2503.17432\\\\\\\"\\\\n    title: \\\\\\\"TamedPUMA: Safe and Stable Imitation Learning with Geometric Fabrics\\\\\\\"\\\\n    authors: \\\\\\\"Bakker et al.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    year: 2025\\\\n    venue: L4DC 2025\\\\n    arxiv: \\\\\\\"2503.17432\\\\\\\"\\\\n    role: related-approach\\\\n    category: safe-rl\\\\n    summary: \\\\\\\"将学习的运动基元与 geometric fabrics 融合，在运行时强制碰撞回避和关节限制，需已知障碍物解析表示。\\\\\\\"\\\\n    relevance: \\\\\\\"运行时安全机制叠加在 IL 之上；需要运行时解析障碍物表示，ColliForce 在训练时嵌入 SDF 使策略泛化到新场景而无需运行时几何计算。\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 13371, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpquHRciCqyWfEg2rG3pto","session_id":"de8902b1-95db-4d6b-992d-38f39dba7b46","uuid":"7ba694f5-a772-46ef-a3a0-cdd6f7ef6922","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:20:02.322Z"}
