'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 03:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D014: 用户明确要求目标主会（CoRL main / ICRA），不是 workshop。纯 negative results 不够，必须有正向贡献。'\\\\n  rationale: 用户回复\\\\\\\"目标不是workshop\\\\\\\"。主会需要：(1) 至少一个正向方法贡献 (2) 更广泛的 evidence (多 model/benchmark)。当前最直接路径是\\\\n    Pi0.5+A1 成功。如果失败需要替代正向贡献（更高 lambda / 新 SDF 集成方式 / full-body SDF PoC）。禁止 fallback\\\\n    到 workshop。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 13:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D015: Step 10K mid-eval 结果——CAR +49pp 强 positive 但 TSR -51pp，所有 6 runs\\\\n    继续到 30K，D012 gate 从硬阈值改为 Pareto tradeoff 评估'\\\\n  rationale: Task 0 (orange_juice) 46/50 ep 数据：CAR 10%→59% (+49pp), TSR 70.7%→19.6%\\\\n    (-51pp), frozen_rate=0%。CAR 改善是真实碰撞避免（非 fake safety），这是项目首次展示 VLA 上的真实避障行为。TSR\\\\n    下降严重但可能随更长训练缓解（step 10K 仅 33% 训练进度）。D012 硬 gate (TSR≥50%) 在设计时未预期到如此显著的 safety-performance\\\\n    tradeoff，改为 Pareto 评估更合理。6 runs 继续到 30K 看 TSR 是否恢复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: mid-eval\\\\n    result: CAR=58.7% TSR=19.6% frozen=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: mid-eval\\\\n    result: CAR=54.3% TSR=28.3% frozen=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-23 16:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: Step 10K 4-task 完整 mid-eval——D012 gate 技术 FAIL (TSR=49% 差 1%) 但\\\\n    Pareto positive，继续训练到 30K'\\\\n  rationale: CAR 26.8%→56-58% (+30pp)，frozen_rate=0%（全真实避碰），TSR 74.7%→47-49% (-25pp)。D012\\\\n    硬 gate FAIL 但 D015 已改为 Pareto 评估。3/4 tasks CAR 大幅提升，Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 异常（CAR\\\\n    -2pp）。TSR 下降与 baseline 碰撞密度强负相关（Task 0 baseline CAR=10% → ΔTSR=-49pp，Task 1 baseline\\\\n    CAR=56% → ΔTSR=-15pp）。Step 10K=33% 进度，l01 TSR=49% 差 1%，继续到 30K 大概率过 50%。Lambda\\\\n    0.005 vs 0.01 无实质差异。不早停，不 call MVP pass，等 30K final eval。LoRA baseline ablation\\\\n    在 westd-45947 释放后立即启动。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: TSR=47% CAR=58% frozen=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: TSR=49% CAR=56.5% frozen=0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-24 04:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: Task 3 碰撞转移效应确认——双侧障碍走廊中 SDF 梯度导致碰撞从右侧转移到左侧，CAR 恶化 -8pp。方法适用边界明确：SDF\\\\n    在高碰撞率场景有效，窄走廊场景适得其反'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 分析 Step 10K eval 的 per-episode 碰撞矩阵发现：Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 的路径穿过\\\\n    wine_bottle 和 red_coffee_mug 形成的 ~40cm 走廊，point-wise SDF 梯度推离右侧时轨迹偏左撞上 red_coffee_mug（碰撞翻倍\\\\n    5→10）。Baseline 17 个 collision-free episodes 全部成功，A1 的 13 个 collision-free 中仅 2\\\\n    个成功——SDF 让 11 个 episode 避障但未完成任务。与 Task 0（baseline 碰撞率 94%→SDF 有效）形成鲜明对比。这个发现增强论文深度——展示方法适用边界比只报好结果更有学术价值，适合放在\\\\n    Discussion/Limitations。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Task 3 CAR -8pp\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Task 3 CAR -6pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-24 22:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D018: 16 个阴性结果系统分析确认方法边界——gradient-based action correction 在 flow-matching\\\\n    VLA 上全面失败，Pi0.5+A1 training-time SDF 是唯一产生真实避碰的路径'\\\\n  rationale: 系统分析 16 个阴性实验，归因为三类：结构性限制(7)、实现 bug(5)、基座特性(4)。所有 SDF-gradient→action\\\\n    路径（A1 on Pi0 / A3 runtime / GT oracle）均导致 action collapse（96.7-99.6% fake safety）。明确\\\\n    Do Not Retry 清单：action-space/feature-space gradient refinement、EE-only SDF spatial\\\\n    场景、Pi0 基座实验。Pi0.5+A1 10K CAR+30pp frozen=0% 是唯一 positive signal，天花板待 30K 确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: positive\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 06:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D019: 16 个阴性结果叙事分层——Tier A (核心贡献, 正文讨论) / Tier B (边界条件, appendix) / Tier\\\\n    C (技术失败, 省略)'\\\\n  rationale: Analysis paper 的 negative results 本身是贡献而非失败。分 3 层避免 reviewer 认为是 negative-pile-up：Tier\\\\n    A 的 fake safety + oracle 失败 + gradient correction 失败收敛到同一 structural insight (EE-only\\\\n    limitation)，作为不同角度的验证；Tier B 提供 ablation 信息；Tier C 技术性失败不含科学结论。叙事用 \\\\\\\"we demonstrate\\\\\\\"\\\\n    而非 \\\\\\\"we failed to\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\\\\n    role: Tier A - fake safety\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: Tier A - oracle failure\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\\\\n    role: Tier A - oracle failure\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_object_v11\\\\n    role: Tier A - oracle failure\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\\\\n    role: Tier B - lambda sensitivity\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\\\n    role: Tier B - lambda sensitivity\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 07:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D020: 30K TSR退化揭示safety-performance tradeoff——10K是当前最优checkpoint，λ_sdf=0\\\\n    Phase 2 ablation升为最高优先级'\\\\n  rationale: 30K中期数据：CAR维持(~55% vs 10K ~57%)但TSR显著退化(20-32% vs 10K 47-49%)。诊断：持续SDF\\\\n    auxiliary loss导致policy过度优先碰撞避免，牺牲task performance。这不是bug而是核心finding——揭示了auxiliary\\\\n    safety signal与policy learning的动态交互。直接推论：(1) 10K可能是safety-performance最优平衡点；(2)\\\\n    Phase-scheduled training (SDF warmup → task-only finetuning)是自然的mitigation方案，对应已计划的λ_sdf=0\\\\n    Phase 2 ablation。将该ablation从nice-to-have升为最高优先级，用cuda:2启动。λ=0.005跨seed一致优于λ=0.01(CAR\\\\n    +2pp, TSR +8pp)，确认spatial_bowl用λ=0.005。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 32% CAR 54.7% (mid-eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 22.5% CAR 54.2% (mid-eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 26.1% CAR 57.1% (mid-eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TSR 20.3% CAR 53.4% (mid-eval)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 17:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: Displacement 度量修复方案——用 EE displacement 替代 obstacle displacement\\\\n    做 frozen 判定；Task 1 存在 ~32% 初始化 baseline 需扣除'\\\\n  rationale: 1) analyze_displacement.py 的 Filtered CAR=0% 是 L1/L2 范数不等式导致的数学恒等式（M044），不是实验发现。obstacle\\\\n    displacement 对所有 safe episode 恒为近零，无法区分主动避障和冻结。需新增 EE displacement（max_ee_displacement\\\\n    + total_ee_path_length）才能做定量 frozen 分析。2) Reviewer 发现 Task 1 约 32% episode 初始化时\\\\n    chocolate_pudding 已在 basket 附近，物理 settling 导致不动也判成功。所有模型的 Task 1 TSR 比较需扣除此 baseline。30K\\\\n    avg_TSR 4-9% 几乎全来自此效应。论文中 Task 1 TSR 改善声明需谨慎。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: frozen analysis invalid due to M044\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s2_l01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 20:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D022: 暂停\\\\\\\"30K = action collapse / 100% frozen\\\\\\\"叙事——旧 displacement 数据基于 buggy\\\\n    eval 脚本（M044/M045），需等修复后 r4/disp eval 提供正确 EE displacement 数据才能定论'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现 displacement_analysis_30k_summary.txt 的\\\\\\\"100% frozen\\\\\\\"结论来自\\\\n    buggy 的 max_ee_displacement 字段（恒 < 0.001m）。LOG 中 \\\\\\\"Avg max displacement\\\\\\\" 实际是 obstacle\\\\n    displacement 而非 EE displacement，之前对比分析在比较不同量纲。当前 r4/disp 重跑使用修复后脚本，将提供正确数据。在此之前\\\\n    MVP 判定中不引用\\\\\\\"30K frozen\\\\\\\"结论。两种可能结果：(1) 30K EE disp 确实低 → frozen confirmed；(2) 30K\\\\n    EE disp 高 → 需修改 degradation 机制解释。10K best sweet spot 已有 2-seed 正确数据支撑（s1@16K EE=0.513m,\\\\n    s2@10K EE=0.505m, 均 0% fake）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp\\\\n    role: key_evidence\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4\\\\n    role: key_evidence\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k\\\\n    role: confirmed_positive\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k\\\\n    role: confirmed_positive\\\\n    result: killed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-25 20:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: \\\\\\\"30K action collapse\\\\\\\"叙事被修正数据彻底推翻——30K EE disp 0.497m ≈ 10K best\\\\n    0.505m，SDF 效果跨步数一致，论文叙事从\\\\\\\"training dynamics/collapse\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"consistent but extreme\\\\n    safety-performance tradeoff\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: '首个修正后 30K eval 数据（seed0_l005, 使用修复后 eval 脚本含正确 max_ee_displacement）：30K\\\\n    avg EE=0.497m, TSR=9%, CAR=49.5%。与 seed2 best(10K) avg EE=0.505m/TSR=9%/CAR=55.5%\\\\n    和 seed1 best(16K) avg EE=0.513m/TSR=6.5%/CAR=53% 在噪声范围内。机械臂从未冻结。之前\\\\\\\"100% frozen\\\\\\\"结论完全来自\\\\n    buggy eval 脚本（M044/M045）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    新理解：SDF aux loss 创造一致的 safety-aware behavior（CAR ~50-55%, TSR ~5-9%, EE ~0.5m），不随训练步数变化。对比\\\\n    baseline（TSR=73%, CAR=27%），SDF 的 tradeoff 是 CAR +25pp 换 TSR -65pp——真实有效但代价极端。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    论文影响：(1) Claim 1-3 不变；(2) Claim 4 从\\\\\\\"sweet spot + collapse\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"consistent real avoidance\\\\n    with extreme tradeoff\\\\\\\"；(3) 不再需要\\\\\\\"best checkpoint\\\\\\\"策略，因为任何步数效果相同；(4) Phase 2 λ=0\\\\n    ablation 动机从\\\\\\\"防止 collapse\\\\\\\"变为\\\\\\\"恢复 task performance\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    待确认：需 s1 30K + s0 l01 修正数据确认跨 seed/lambda 一致性。LoRA baseline 仍是 attribution 关键。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l005_r4\\\\n    role: key_evidence\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_best_s1_l005_16k\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: killed\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp\\\\n    role: confirmation_needed\\\\n    result: failed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-26 00:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Dream assessment: borderline scores (4.5-6/10) identify 5 structural gaps;\\\\n    expanding experiment plan to address'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260525T223036 returned best=5-6, median=4.5, worst=5.\\\\n    All tiers agree on: (1) references critically insufficient (5→25+), (2) Phase\\\\n    2 needs multi-seed replication, (3) LoRA attribution needs 3rd seed for statistical\\\\n    rigor, (4) threshold sensitivity missing (δ choices unjustified), (5) cross-model\\\\n    comparison needs reframing. Adding 4 new experiments to plan: Phase 2 additional\\\\n    seed, LoRA 3rd seed, threshold sensitivity (CPU), spatial_bowl LoRA control. References\\\\n    and novelty framing are Paper Agent tasks for writing phase. Current running experiments\\\\n    (lambda=0.1×2, LoRA baseline, Phase 2 seed2, spatial_bowl) already cover some\\\\n    gaps.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260525T223036\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: borderline 4.5-6/10\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-26 02:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Claim 4 SDF attribution overturned: LoRA-only CAR=55% ≥ SDF CAR=52%, SDF\\\\n    contributes 0pp. Paper pivots to diagnostic + negative finding'\\\\n  rationale: 'LoRA baseline eval (2 seeds, 30K, 200ep each) shows CAR=55.3% vs SDF\\\\n    3-seed mean 50.5-52.8%. Per-task pattern identical. TSR equally collapsed (6.25%\\\\n    vs 6.5%). SDF geometric supervision adds nothing to collision avoidance — the\\\\n    +29pp CAR improvement over Pi0.5 baseline comes entirely from LoRA fine-tuning\\\\n    on collision-free demonstrations. Reviewer confirmed severity: critical. Paper\\\\n    narrative must shift: Claim 4 changes from \\\\\\\"SDF produces real avoidance\\\\\\\" to \\\\\\\"LoRA\\\\n    fine-tuning produces real avoidance, SDF is redundant.\\\\\\\" Paper becomes stronger\\\\n    as diagnostic/analysis paper with a valuable negative finding. Running experiments\\\\n    (Phase 2, λ=0.1) continue for completeness but expectations change — Phase 2 \\\\\\\"safety\\\\n    persistence\\\\\\\" is less relevant if SDF never contributed safety.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=54.5%, TSR=8.5%, EE=0.489m\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: CAR=56%, TSR=4%, EE=0.467m\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D024\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 20518, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpquHRciCqyWfEg2rG3pto","session_id":"de8902b1-95db-4d6b-992d-38f39dba7b46","uuid":"5f3c7afb-2a99-44a9-a581-57071c3eeb4a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T03:20:02.862Z"}
